Before starting the stack, create `.secrets/alertmanager_smtp_password` with your
new Google app password. Keep the file local and do not commit it:

```bash
umask 077
mkdir -p .secrets
read -rsp "Gmail app password: " password
printf '%s' "$password" > .secrets/alertmanager_smtp_password
unset password
```

Revoke any app password previously committed to the repository in your Google
Account's Security settings.